<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>More Statistics</h2>

<figure id="A1.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.14232v1/subject_level2.png" id="A1.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:329/329;" width="329" height="329" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span><span id="A1.F8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Level-2 taxonomy of GenExam.</span> Detailed four-level taxonomy is in Sec <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Full Taxonomy List ‣ GenExam: A Multidisciplinary Text-to-Image Exam" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fig. <a href="#A1.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix A More Statistics ‣ GenExam: A Multidisciplinary Text-to-Image Exam" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> shows all the level-2 taxonomy in GenExam, and Fig. <a href="#A1.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix A More Statistics ‣ GenExam: A Multidisciplinary Text-to-Image Exam" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>(a) and (b) show the distribution of subjects in GenExam-Full and GenExam-Mini. We include more samples for science and engineering subjects while also covering subjects related to humanity and social science, such as Economics, Music, and History. GenExam-Mini is constructed using stratified sampling on level-3 taxonomy, which ensures similar distributions between GenExam-Full and GenExam-Mini.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The proportion of image sources is presented in Fig. <a href="#A1.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix A More Statistics ‣ GenExam: A Multidisciplinary Text-to-Image Exam" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>(c), demonstrating the diversity of images in our benchmark.
Word clouds of prompts in each subject are shown in Fig. <a href="#A1.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix A More Statistics ‣ GenExam: A Multidisciplinary Text-to-Image Exam" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, where we observe keywords with dense subject knowledge similar to human exams.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A1.F9.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.14232v1/figures/subject_full_pie_chart.png" id="A1.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:165/143;" width="165" height="143" alt="Refer to caption">
